---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: In the news
description: Service activities of the Rotary clubs of District 3110 reported by newspapers and news websites, with links to each news item.
permalink: /news/
---
<div class="wrap section narrow">
  <h1>{{ t.news.title }}</h1>
  <p class="lead">{{ t.news.intro }}</p>
  {%- if site.news.length %}
  <ul class="news-list">
    {%- for a in site.news %}
    <li>
      <p class="meta">{{ a.press.paper }}{% if a.press.dateLabel %} · {{ a.press.dateLabel }}{% endif %}</p>
      <h2><a href="{{ a.url }}">{{ a.title }}</a></h2>
      <p class="small">{{ a.club.name }}{% if a.press.link %} · <a href="{{ a.press.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ t.activity.press_read }} ↗</a>{% endif %}</p>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  {%- else %}
  <p>{{ t.news.empty }}</p>
  {%- endif %}
  <p class="small">Was your club's activity in the news? Add the paper's name, date and link when you <a href="/submit/">send the activity</a>.</p>
</div>
